                                "sense_id": "28c997fd-e9f5-3401-a886-39f8fcce75a5",
                                "text": "San Francisco's Board of Supervisors last month approved a new zoning law designed to limit the height and size of office towers and to reduce by half the projected employment growth downtown over the next 15 years. ¶ Adoption of the plan came after more than a decade of complaints from San Franciscans that their city was being \"Manhattanized.\""
